    "description": "The Careers Applications Interviews API enables users to retrieve a comprehensive list of interview records related to job applications. This resource is essential for recruiters and hiring managers to analyze candidate progress and schedule interviews efficiently. By accessing this endpoint, users can view critical details about each interview, including candidate information, interview schedules, and statuses. Typical consumers of this API include HR departments and recruitment software systems seeking to streamline their hiring process and track interview outcomes effectively.",
